{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_07",
  "title": "龟裂",
  "storyCode": "DM-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3af8c26e41f38fdf5019e420908161f509ef02dc697171d5334f60984a8f6140",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......我对你有印象......同胞。我们在战场上见过面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉，唉。你不该来切尔诺伯格，罗德岛的信息已经分发给了全队。你和你的部下都会死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，即使你们如此优秀，还是不应该如此轻易地穿过W负责的防线，除非......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么说来，她还是做出了这个选择。其实我们都有预料到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们中有人曾和我们并肩作战。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这是我们还在战场上谈话的唯一理由。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......特蕾西娅是个卓越的领袖，她改变了很多人对这片大地的看法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "理想化的看法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不用急着反驳，我比你更清楚卡兹戴尔所面临的残酷，我并不想否定她，但比起一个伟大的过程，我只想要一个微不足道的结果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只有如今摄政王的手腕能为萨卡兹带来新的未来，绝不是泛滥的善意。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们本可以试着携手共进，至少不用同归于尽。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "愚蠢的想法，萨卡兹绵长的愤懑如何安放？长久以来的倾斜如何扶正？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "未感染者，乌萨斯。感染者，整合运动。萨卡兹，卡兹戴尔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "都是一回事，与整合运动合作的日子里我更加确信了这件事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "摄政王殿下能为我们开拓一个新的家园，我只是选择追随这个可能性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一如当年，你们天真地追随特蕾西娅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "既然W把你放了进来，你一定也付出了代价。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你付出了什么呢？为了拖延时间掩护你而丧命的部下？甚至是......你自己？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "告诉我你现在的名字吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——Scout。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "很耳熟的代号，为表尊重，我本来是想把你的本名刻在这把刀上。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "雇佣兵不也都是用假名的吗，加尔森。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵领袖",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_054",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......你说得也对。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "放弃抵抗吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......还有你的十二位队员，已经被确认全灭了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "雷发，米米，图钉，死于整合运动术师的包围网正中，有一个是站着死的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小玛丽，长音，斯琳珂，长蝎占据了一处阵线，W亲自带队过去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "姆拉姆，酒莓软芯，淤兰，和我们的一支小队同归于尽，有人杀出了重围，然后被赫德雷的刀兵斩首。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "普特尔刚才死在那栋楼下，很意外，好像是为了救一个没来得及撤出的平民。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "索拉娜还留着一口气，被带回去了，想必她会想方设法自尽的吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......还不吭声吗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别躲了，你听得见，影子一清二楚，你的气息混乱不堪，伤得不轻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你为什么知道他们的名字？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "W特意嘱咐过，你们会把兵牌一类的东西挂在身上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“至少杀了谁还是要弄明白的，这里毕竟不是卡兹戴尔，不留神杀错人可就不好办了”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那不是兵牌，牺牲的那些干员们......也不全是士兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我以为会是W来亲自动手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她......哼，我要是说她不忍心亲手解决你，你会信吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "摄政王派来的领袖已经被你杀了，想要接管的可不止她一个，她现在比较忙。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像当时你和W说好的一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一旦你完成任务，我们就会“后知后觉”地全力歼灭你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你在巷战的过程中还抽空救了个人。但现在，那不是我们的管辖范围。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是爱国者在那里，你不需要过问。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......这样，就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们......变了，过去的W不是个会刻意记住死者名讳的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她确实变了，但更多时候是变得更像个疯子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你纯粹的战地经验就堪比浮士德的源石技艺，说不定只是为了让你动摇，好让我用法术捕捉你才故意记下名字的呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......老样子，总不放过任何取乐的机会。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "彼此，你不是也接受了这种W才能想出来的疯狂交易。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "用我的命换取一个机会，再让该把握住这个机会的人把握住它，这并不疯狂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "还有我牺牲的队员们，也一样。他们为了自己的理念而死，没有他们，我无法成功。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......看来时过境迁，大家都有一些变化。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也是，过去的你绝不会像现在这样，给敌人喘息的空间。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "赫德雷应该提醒过你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "为什么还要抵抗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......啧，不见了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但愿你能就这么逃掉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（这个方向吗？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（没错，这里。动作真快。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（麻烦的家伙，如果他没有受伤，恐怕我连他人都见不着......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（等等。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（他......他在向核心城转移？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（那里——啧！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......该死！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "已经这么靠近核心城了，你到底想干什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "老老实实离开切尔诺伯格不行吗！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......你有时候真不像是个萨卡兹，伊内丝。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我本来就不是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——你该继续装下去的，你是个萨卡兹雇佣兵，而这里是战场。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "现在你跑不动了，失血过多，头晕，四肢发冷，除了你的影子像是要烧起来一样，你不应该还能站着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的伤，我自己有数，何况这里还有那么多的整合运动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而对你们......你，赫德雷，还有W......我有一个建议。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......念在殿下的份上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "用你的眼睛看清真相，在那之前不要白白死去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们......萨卡兹不该这样继续被人利用了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你在说法术？这里能看到什——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "————"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——这是......这......这是谁......这种......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉？",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "......萨卡兹？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不可能，被察觉到了——！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（机会——！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "很久不见了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔......你？你原来......还活着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我一直在跟着你，只靠伊内丝，很难对付你这样的高手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "虽然交易内容就是要付出性命，我们也没打算手下留情，但我还是希望你能......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可现在我们已经不能给你更多机会了，这里太过靠近核心城了，W不希望任何人的注意力转移到这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵......听上去......现在她才是队长了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你......原来......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......抱歉。睡吧，老朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Scout",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你们......不该继续待在这里......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我知道的，老朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我一直都知道的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "赫德雷！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_047",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你刚才动摇了，为什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——快走！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们必须马上通知W，必须——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伊内丝",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啧！她靠近了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_052",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
